{"id":"1d599cf76617bbbc","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing5-generic-extension-by-filter.md","title":"ZFC Forcing5 Generic Extension By Filter","display":"df-zfc-forcing5-generic-extension-by-filter — ZFC Forcing5 Generic Extension By Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-generic-extension-by-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing5-generic-extension-by-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing5-generic-extension-by-filter — ZFC Forcing5 Generic Extension By Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-generic-extension-by-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing5-generic-extension-by-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing5-generic-extension-by-filter — ZFC Forcing5 Generic Extension By Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic\">../batch16/58-df-generic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a9a09c4855ab3f8\" href=\"?note=3a9a09c4855ab3f8\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in V\">\\(M,N\\in V\\)</span> (ground-model and extension candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span> (forcing poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in V\">\\(G\\in V\\)</span> (generic-filter candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span> (transitive ZFC-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}\\)</span> (generic-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic\">../batch16/58-df-generic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingName}_S\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S(x,\\sigma,G,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S(x,\\sigma,G,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (recursive name-evaluation relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3a9a09c4855ab3f8\" href=\"?note=3a9a09c4855ab3f8\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5GenericExtensionByFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5GenericExtensionByFilter}_S\\)</span> (generic-extension predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}by\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5GenericExtensionByFilter}_S(M,\\mathbb P,G,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathbb P\\in M\\land\n\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\land\nN=\\{x:\\exists\\sigma\\in M\\;(\\mathrm{ForcingName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S(x,\\sigma,G,\\mathbb P))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}by\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5GenericExtensionByFilter}_S(M,\\mathbb P,G,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathbb P\\in M\\land\n\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\land\nN=\\{x:\\exists\\sigma\\in M\\;(\\mathrm{ForcingName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S(x,\\sigma,G,\\mathbb P))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","ex